# Cursor-native agent context

- Allowed under `.cursor/`: `AGENTS.md`, `rules/*.mdc`, `skills/*/SKILL.md`,
  `commands/*.md`, `agents/*.md`, `hooks.json`, `hooks/`, `mcp.json`,
  `cli.json`.
- Do **not** recreate custom trees (`personas/`, `memory/`, `workflows/`,
  `instructions/`, top-level `scripts/`, etc.).
- Rules use `.mdc` — not `.rules.md`.
- Slash commands use `.md` — not `.command.md`.
- Subagents use `.cursor/agents/<name>.md` — not `.agent.md`.
- New multi-step workflows → a skill via `create-skill-pro`.
- Cross-cutting automation → `.cursor/hooks/` (Node `.mjs`).

```text
❌ BAD: .cursor/personas/ or .cursor/agents/foo.agent.md
✅ GOOD: .cursor/agents/foo.md and .cursor/rules/bar.mdc
```
